        <p>By placing an order with Cybex Precision Gunworx ("CPG," "we," "us"), you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. Please read them carefully before making a purchase.</p>

        <h2>Age Requirements</h2>
        <p>You must be at least 21 years of age to purchase handguns and 18 years of age to purchase long guns. You must be legally eligible to purchase and possess firearms under all applicable federal, state, and local laws.</p>

        <h2>FFL Transfer Requirement</h2>
        <p>All complete firearms and serialized lower receivers must be shipped to a licensed Federal Firearms Licensee (FFL). It is your responsibility to ensure your selected FFL can legally receive the item(s) you purchase.</p>

        <h2>Compliance</h2>
        <p>CPG will not ship any product that violates federal, state, or local laws. It is the buyer's responsibility to know and comply with all applicable firearms laws in their jurisdiction.</p>

        <h2>Pricing & Availability</h2>
