        <p>CPG is not liable for any damages resulting from the misuse, modification, or improper maintenance of any product purchased from us. Our liability is limited to the purchase price of the product.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com">sales@cybexprecisiongunworx.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
